1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,703
Golden lines sketch a city.

2
00:00:03,793 --> 00:00:04,502
Smoke billows from etched smokestacks.

3
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:09,622
The glowing city shrinks away.

4
00:00:24,912 --> 00:00:25,606
The glowing figure stands tall.

5
00:00:33,122 --> 00:00:35,275
A dark, angular figure appears, raising a hand among the faithful.

6
00:00:40,313 --> 00:00:43,802
The demon reaches out with jagged claws. The faithful scatter in terror.

7
00:00:49,168 --> 00:00:50,702
A faithful warrior battles the heretic.

8
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:56,742
The warrior strikes him down.

9
00:01:02,210 --> 00:01:05,546
The glowing murals decorate the walls of a dark, hexagonal chamber.

10
00:01:11,512 --> 00:01:12,247
A Vodyani leader stands tall.

11
00:01:14,157 --> 00:01:20,000
Clad in a bulky black suit with a glowing orange faceplate, the figure holds a long staff.

12
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:24,000
The balcony sits within the windowed bridge of a colossal starship.

13
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Outside in the void, a massive fleet of jagged vessels flanks the great Ark.

14
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Glowing orange thrusters propel the armada forward into the starry expanse.

15
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:36,682
Everything fades to black.
